  m_text: 'Welcome! Apparently, my grandfather''s elves are not coping with their
    task. Help me collect all the candies in a gift box.

    To control the candies
    you need to click on the screen, then they will jump, be careful, as there will
    be obstacles waiting for you and the distance between the shelves. Complete the
    levels and collect all the candies in the box'
